<div style="font-family: Inter, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #0B1F3A; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <p style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 16px;">Eas<span style="color: #FF7A1A;">Alpha</span></p>
  <p>Hello <%= @user.name %>,</p>
  <p><strong><%= @business.name %></strong> is set up on EasAlpha. Your free trial runs until <strong><%= @trial_ends.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %></strong>; nothing is charged before then.</p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;"><a href="<%= @site %>/login" style="background: #FF7A1A; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block;">Log in to EasAlpha</a></p>
  <p style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;">Three things to do first</p>
  <ol style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 0;">
    <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Add your menu: Products, then Categories and Products (or import a CSV).</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Set up the till: install EasAlpha POS from <a href="<%= @site %>/download" style="color: #C2410C;"><%= @site %>/download</a>, or open <a href="<%= @site %>/setup" style="color: #C2410C;"><%= @site %>/setup</a> on any computer and sign in once.</li>
    <li>Add your team: Staff, then Users. Each person gets a PIN for the till.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Questions? Reply to this email or write to <a href="mailto:<%= @support %>" style="color: #C2410C;"><%= @support %></a>. We answer 24/7.</p>
  <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 32px;">The EasAlpha team · <a href="<%= @site %>" style="color: #64748b;"><%= @site %></a></p>
</div>
